# MAGIC <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">07</span><span class="sec-icon">🩺</span><h2>Diagnosing a slow query</h2></div><ol>
# MAGIC <li>Open the <strong>query profile</strong> (SQL / serverless) or the <strong>Spark UI</strong> (classic).</li>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Files pruned ≈ 0</strong> on a selective filter? → layout problem: clustering, statistics, predicate.</li>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Sort-merge join</strong> with a small side? → broadcast / statistics.</li>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Shuffle bytes</strong> huge? → filter early, broadcast, pre-aggregate.</li>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Max task time ≫ median</strong>? → skew.</li>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Spill</strong> &gt; 0? → partitions or memory.</li>
# MAGIC <li>Only then: bigger compute, or Photon if it isn't on yet.</li>
# MAGIC </ol>
# MAGIC </div>

